msgstr ""
"Če želite spremeniti samodejne odgovore za {address}, MailCraft potrebuje vaše dovoljenje za spreminjanje nastavitev nabiralnika. Microsoftova stran se enkrat odpre v brskalniku in vas vpraša.\n"
"\n"
"MailCraft z njim spremeni samo vaše samodejne odgovore in pravila mape Prejeto, nikoli pa ne kategorij ali delovnega časa. Za branje samodejnih odgovorov to ni potrebno."

#. interface
#: crates/ui-egui/src/rule_sync.rs
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"To keep the rules of {address} on its server, where they run even while MailCraft is closed and show in Outlook on the web and on your phone, MailCraft needs your permission to change your mailbox settings, where Microsoft keeps the rules. Microsoft's page opens in your browser to ask you, once.\n"
"\n"
"Until you allow it, your rules stay on this computer and nothing of them is sent to Microsoft."
msgstr ""
"Če želite pravila za {address} hraniti na njegovem strežniku, kjer se izvajajo tudi ob zaprtem MailCraft in so vidna v Outlooku v spletu ter v telefonu, MailCraft potrebuje vaše dovoljenje za spreminjanje nastavitev nabiralnika, kjer Microsoft hrani pravila. Microsoftova stran se enkrat odpre v brskalniku in vas vpraša.\n"
"\n"
"Dokler tega ne dovolite, pravila ostanejo v tem računalniku in nič od njih se ne pošlje Microsoftu."

#. interface
#: crates/ui-egui/src/task_sync.rs
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
